          <commentary>0.5 kg/min이면 B가 잃는 열이 A가 얻는 열의 절반이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>1</choice_text>
          <commentary>2 × 2c × 10 = mB × c × 40에서 mB = 1 kg/min이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>2</choice_text>
          <commentary>2 kg/min이면 B가 잃는 열이 A가 얻는 열의 2배가 된다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>4</choice_text>
          <commentary>4 kg/min이면 열수지에 맞지 않는다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
